{"rc":{"cells":[{"id":"f","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"6pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"-1","maxLines":"6","text":"${@i18n.sNote}","fontSize":"11pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"sNote":"金额为预估：按每一天的汇率把各币种收益折算成你选的结算币种（汇率来自 Frankfurter 的公开数据），与 Apple 实际付款会有出入（税费、汇率、退款）。国家分布只计首次下载。"},"en-US":{"sNote":"Proceeds are estimates: each day's proceeds are converted to your chosen currency at that day's rate (public rates from Frankfurter) and will differ from what Apple pays (taxes, exchange rates, refunds). Countries count first-time downloads only."}}}}
